          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Opioid drugs can bind to opioid receptors in the presynaptic membrane of a cholinergic synapse.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fig. 1.2 is a diagram of a presynaptic membrane with an opioid receptor.",
