            "source": {
              "qp": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Opioid drugs have an effect on the normal events that occur at a cholinergic synapse.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Suggest <b>and</b> explain the effect that an opioid drug will have on the normal events that occur at a cholinergic synapse.",
